{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y部分感受词存在重复和比喻堆叠，个别地方略显用力；X的叙述更自然连贯，读起来更顺。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把人物心理拆成短而明确的推进步骤，并用加亮关键词帮助观众迅速抓住每段重点；感受词又有大小层次和音乐时点配合，不必一次读完所有信息。尤其人物从隐藏心意、害怕失去、尝试坦然接受，到不再要求永远保证的变化，Y呈现得更细密，音乐变化与心理变化也结合得更紧。X的语言更流畅凝练，但部分心理转折被长句包在一起，扫屏时不如Y容易逐层接住。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2016914e-e988-4341-a6a5-2b42270f8ed5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T182746532251Z", "elapsed_seconds": 159.171, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:30:25.711095+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "80c12e8256660b86470266276c9279dd1d3bb40d5000a468fb7d534a40978875", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee